    "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/803640/extras/d05d0bb4f2395c66745815d4853e6eee.avif?t=1690301400\" /></div></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><strong><i>Knocking hats off &quot;Employee&quot;'s head</i></strong> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/803640/extras/afb7d777bacd9f60fda1a1ec817d98b5.poster.avif?t=1690301400\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/803640/extras/afb7d777bacd9f60fda1a1ec817d98b5.webm?t=1690301400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/803640/extras/afb7d777bacd9f60fda1a1ec817d98b5.mp4?t=1690301400\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong><i>Tossing props to distract employee, they'll go to investigate</i></strong> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/803640/extras/988ae8db903dc4aeb4a0fd2d8fd95cc8.poster.avif?t=1690301400\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/803640/extras/988ae8db903dc4aeb4a0fd2d8fd95cc8.webm?t=1690301400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/803640/extras/988ae8db903dc4aeb4a0fd2d8fd95cc8.mp4?t=1690301400\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong><i>You might consider using Magunet against more distant employee</i></strong> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/803640/extras/80de0538f9cd5fc35c7b5b8ee0cf61ba.poster.avif?t=1690301400\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/803640/extras/80de0538f9cd5fc35c7b5b8ee0cf61ba.webm?t=1690301400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/803640/extras/80de0538f9cd5fc35c7b5b8ee0cf61ba.mp4?t=1690301400\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong><i>Standing in the 2.25m\u00b2 place, Taking over all the stages</i></strong> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/803640/extras/53094e088a0cea16c789004d91a4ce7b.avif?t=1690301400\" /></div><br><strong><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Defeat all enemies to proceed to the next room.<br></li><li>The enemies' only weak point is their hats. Throw objects at their hats to defeat them.<br></li><li>Challenge more than 60+ puzzles in the lowpoly world. More and more puzzles will be released afterwards.<br></li><li>Using various abilities such as magnetic, time, space, and various physical mechanisms to defeat all enemies.<br></li><li>Unique music and sound effects in harmony with the colorful visuals, all of them are inspired by plenty of YouTube music and meme culture.<br></li><li>No dizzy \u2014 only locomotion VR\u2014 in fact player will not leave the 2.25m\u00b2 area under feet.</li></ul></strong><br><br>Phantom Matrix is a theatrical, physics-based, stealth puzzle action game in Virtual Reality. You are a game developer whose game has been robbed, your mission is to seek the truth after all mankind has been possessed. Armed with your wits and the &quot;game&quot; power, it\u2019s time to save your game and friends.<br><br>7 Chapters, 7 Boss Levels, 7 Abilities (Gadgets)<br>- New abilities obtained by defeating Boss.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/803640/extras/d4de98c12fce90594241b9f6ba519406.avif?t=1690301400\" /></div><br>You and your six mates have created the best game in the world. <br>Just the moment you launch the game, a weird skyscraper suddenly drilled out of the ground and <strong>the big hands fall</strong>. Your game disappeared, your friends were missing, and all the humans in the world have been kidnapped. Four cats save you in danger, it's time to sneak into building and save your friends.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/803640/extras/25e5d851f32cfd9fbadd026cc8dd13cc.avif?t=1690301400\" /></div><br>Throwing, tossing, shooting, etc., this game requires all kinds of skills because you need to throwing anything at enemies' head to knock their hat off.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/803640/extras/2445c162765c59a28ec094ecfacfe053.avif?t=1690301400\" /></div><br>Almost all gameplay and mechanisms in the game are achieved through physical simulation.<br>By the way, you need to be <strong>sneaky</strong> or the enemy will lock down the whole building.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/803640/extras/99f41e24d82fed806795245da82b2fa4.avif?t=1690301400\" /></div><br>You need a 2.25m\u00b2 place for Room-Scale.",
