pped. Four cats save you in danger, it's time to sneak into building and save your friends.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/803640/extras/25e5d851f32cfd9fbadd026cc8dd13cc.avif?t=1690301400\" /></div><br>Throwing, tossing, shooting, etc., this game requires all kinds of skills because you need to throwing anything at enemies' head to knock their hat off.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/803640/extras/2445c162765c59a28ec094ecfacfe053.avif?t=1690301400\" /></div><br>Almost all gameplay and mechanisms in the game are achieved through physical simulation.<br>By the way, you need to be <strong>sneaky</strong> or the enemy will lock down the whole building.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/803640/extras/99f41e24d82fed806795245da82b2fa4.avif?t=1690301400\" /></div><br>You need a 2.25m\u00b2 place for Room-Scale.",
